ify-between px-6 py-4\"><a class=\"font-semibold text-text-primary\" href=\"/\">Lume Labs</a><ul class=\"hidden gap-8 md:flex\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text-primary\" href=\"/work\">Work</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text-primary\" href=\"/services\">Services</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text-primary\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li></ul><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-200 bg-surface text-text-primary border border-border hover:bg-surface-hover\" href=\"/contact\">Get in Touch</a></div><button class=\"text-text-primary md:hidden\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></nav></header><main class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">About Lume Labs</h1><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-6 text-text-muted\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p>Lume Labs is the software consultancy of Amelia Santosh — a single engineer building custom web applications, internal tools, and AI-powered systems for businesses that need software done right.</p><p>Working solo means every project gets direct, hands-on attention — no account managers, no hand-offs between teams. You work with the person actually writing the code, from the first conversation to deployment.</p><p>The focus is on building software that&#x27;s reliable, maintainable, and built around how your business actually works — not generic templates retrofitted to fit.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"border-t border-border\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10 flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><p class=\"text-sm text-text-muted\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Lume Labs. Built by Amelia Santosh.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-muted\">ameliasantosh@lumelabs.dev</p></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3tmjyhzhjd_gd.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[3265,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1gbm1b4v-uv-g.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3dcwxlftmhsga.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[47257,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n6:I[61642,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1gbm1b4v-uv-g.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3dcwxlftmhsga.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/19iuqv74le5di.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n9:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\na:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n10:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1gbm1b4v-uv-g.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3dcwxlftmhsga.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1p099j2tzlmqe.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.3t6q91iet4nsy.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"t